       string and AATT__EEMMPPTTYY__PPAATTHH is specified in _f_l_a_g_s, then the mount  proper‐
       ties  of the mount identified by _d_i_r_f_d are changed.  (See ooppeennaatt(2) for
       an explanation of why the _d_i_r_f_d argument is useful.)

